{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a994576678f77e57487f7be3be55bd3dc4e66f197ac738a35e7de319f40cfc7a", "ja": "社長からコラボ企画を任されたプロデューサ\nー。ユニット『Cleasky』の美也とエレナ\nが出演するバラエティ番組の会場で、他事務\n所のユニット『レイジー・レイジー』の\n一ノ瀬志希、宮本フレデリカと出会う。", "zh": "制作人受社长委托负责一项合作企划。在偶像组合\"Cleasky\"的美也和艾莲娜出演的综艺节目会场，与其他事务所的偶像组合\"レイジー・レイジー\"的一ノ瀬志希、宮本フレデリカ相遇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d8c6ab1dd6341876eee4a06d379572ac4aff942f4b4024e08536ae82f42c4db", "ja": "（というワケで、コラボ企画を任せてもらえたけど、\n当然ながら普段の仕事もある）", "zh": "（这么说来，虽然把联动企划交给我负责了，但平时的工作当然也不能落下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e8a685141729d37c3463888f958dcbdd467e49a2f886264fbb44d63c8cb25a90", "ja": "（今日は美也とエレナのユニット『Cleasky』と\nバラエティ番組に出るため、テレビ局にやってきた！）", "zh": "（今天为了和美也、艾蕾娜组成的组合『Cleasky』一起参加综艺节目，我们来到了电视台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "f4be26b68a36e0977d28d2166e164c15f10f0c40bc3607ca0554e3c5176faf66", "ja": "ワオ！　ミヤ、見て見て！\nキレイな子が、いっぱいいるヨ～！", "zh": "哇！美也，快看快看！\n这里有好多漂亮的女孩子哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "a07c115f43b1535ad58f0e9705c43e95d3b9fb1b11bf236f4cf0578f7cfc1425", "ja": "お～、本当ですね～。\nみなさん、アイドルなんでしょうか～？", "zh": "哦～，真的呢～。  \n大家都是偶像吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1bfa86ebb0d7b98d2d28edadc39a061cd64a2cc59e6ad308fc888b88c23a56d3", "ja": "今日は『事務所対抗アイドルクイズ大会スペシャル！』\nだからな。かなりの数のアイドルが集まってるぞ。", "zh": "今天是“事务所对抗偶像知识竞赛特别赛”！\n所以才有这么多偶像聚集在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "96dba08eabf4256dc15047409800842ccc0302fcd44595d836a8edc6ec6624a5", "ja": "私達が765プロの代表、なんですよね～？\n責任重大ですな～。優勝を狙いますよ～、むんっ。", "zh": "我们是765事务所的代表，对吧～？责任重大呢～。目标是冠军～，嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "a685cd26ff4ca00df72845b7082965a236dfd3e4b50057a8d804558817db2d04", "ja": "う～、仲良くなりたいけど、ライバルなんだよネ？\nじゃあ番組が終わってからかナ～……。", "zh": "唔～，虽然想和大家成为好朋友，但我们是竞争对手对吧？\n那就等节目结束以后再说吧～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f8d88d41b8583a9452326ea8e9c8067c29799f2f9bf8ea1edab234506a8c2bd3", "ja": "（本当に、いろんな事務所のアイドルがいるな。\n……ん？　あの華やかな子たちは、確か……）", "zh": "（真的有好多不同事务所的偶像啊。\n……嗯？那些光彩照人的孩子们，我记得是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1008_205xxx", "source_sha256": "22fbee09e7499d2481459e70da4461e9b7d56801466506dea38d7245de6ab36e", "ja": "ふわぁ～。ん……怪しい人はっけーん！\nもしかして不審者かな～？　もしかしない～？", "zh": "呼啊～。嗯……发现可疑人物！\n难道是可疑分子～？不是难道，而是吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b22908fad1a247695a89b950abf254b55713d3f31930610d6c654edee7816b28", "ja": "えっ？　あ、いや、すみません！\n見つめるような真似しちゃって、不躾でしたよね。", "zh": "咦？啊，不，抱歉！\n刚才一直盯着您看，实在太失礼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1010_205xxx", "source_sha256": "81204fd4f3331a429f98e1d9450cac94eddea97dce235ed738ad38a665d38582", "ja": "こっちのふたりは……。くんくん！\nキョーミ深いにおい～！", "zh": "这边的两位是……嗅嗅！气味真有意思～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1011_204xxx", "source_sha256": "c0d3a2793c1371d3eebf1293d2595cb01e5935394784ecb80d3ddcbaa8f836b6", "ja": "こらこら、急なクンクンはビックリさせちゃうよ～。\nすみません、ウチのシキちゃんが！", "zh": "喂喂，突然凑过去闻可是会吓到人的哦～  \n不好意思，我家志希给你添麻烦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1012_204xxx", "source_sha256": "0ea13df77fdf70be31ec6fc604d1dcf99c91f83452f9a8196415d807619681a3", "ja": "でもでも、とってもキュートでカワイイでしょ？\nだから許してね～、メルシー♪", "zh": "但是但是，是不是特别可爱又惹人喜欢？\n所以就原谅我们吧～Merci♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "05927276643fa052e923e1ff56796b909184d2ea59181cfff13c9d1fb4e67558", "ja": "おや～？　あなた達は……。", "zh": "哎呀～？你们是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1014_205xxx", "source_sha256": "38bcfe999e0fd21ce8137a4afa59186b776d23546383db368d463bd6e660d3da", "ja": "どもども～、あたしは一ノ瀬志希的存在～？", "zh": "嗨嗨～，我算是一之濑志希那样的存在～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1015_204xxx", "source_sha256": "66fb81ab141f5974405ad3fd005beabb47ec9b460b8eb8ed55039555f931514e", "ja": "そしてアタシが、宮本フレデリカ的存在～？\nふたりそろって～……？", "zh": "然后我就是，宫本芙蕾德莉卡般的存在～？\n两个人凑在一起～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "12913364270a59ff1cc93d0424da7c5abd1f897d0f90598af9729bd88dd0e15d", "ja": "そうだ、『レイジー・レイジー』さん！", "zh": "对了，是“Lazy Lazy”组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1017_204xxx", "source_sha256": "236a78825e2b0f8d996581f82211dca2d283b75c0b33df5638c7ed98a4cd3d47", "ja": "わーお、キミが言っちゃうんだ！\nあはは、アタシ達のコト、知ってたんだね！", "zh": "哇哦，居然是你说出来的！\n啊哈哈，原来你知道我们呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "790a8781bc85401cc499c8a5d21f7f23382192b1d30da942583e7223a5994a3d", "ja": "もちろん、人気のデュオユニットだからね。\n今日はよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "当然啦，毕竟是很受欢迎的双人组合嘛。\n今天请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "ce7c1b0debd09243a5a9f3aa2c83cf2f6bd7c72cc8f1b5bdf2b5d38b0a022b07", "ja": "よろしくお願いします～。\n765プロの宮尾美也です～。特技は将棋です～。", "zh": "请多关照～  \n我是765Pro的宫尾美也～。特长是下将棋～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "4e059cef2b532d4e9feaf71e4b9a38a12c9d73c2a35706e0145e33c9a8dda885", "ja": "ワタシは島原エレナだヨ～！　ワタシと\nミヤで『Cleasky』っていうノ。よろしくネ！", "zh": "我就是岛原艾琳娜哦～！我和美也组成的组合叫作『Cleasky』。请多关照啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1021_204xxx", "source_sha256": "275a0c120b44cbf27e7d27f3a16c9dcc898610047995fa26eb49a1ad6a272b5c", "ja": "ミヤちゃんにエレナちゃんかー。よろしく♪\n事務所の存続をかけて、正々堂々勝負だ～！", "zh": "美也和艾蕾娜啊。请多关照♪  \n为了事务所的存续，堂堂正正地一决胜负吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "606231f6f4418a51d04c42586ca8a0fccbc5b0c486c0c446adb5c6ae7c80d62d", "ja": "ええっ！？　事務所がかかってるノ！？\nぜったい負けられないヨ～！", "zh": "诶诶！？居然关系到事务所的存亡！？  \n绝对不能输哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7937c7c7450edaf5d34d57ec0aeb96952f3a016131fd074e36b798ad1a1043dd", "ja": "いや、そういう話じゃない……かな？", "zh": "不，不是那个意思……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1024_205xxx", "source_sha256": "dd28c7dbee6ef442e49aead54803604a071dc31b9d4f1b74f63e53d241129749", "ja": "志希ちゃんネムネムだから、新鮮なシゲキが必要～。\n美也ちゃん、匂いかがせて～。……クンクン！", "zh": "志希现在困呼呼的，需要新鲜的刺激～。\n美也，让我闻闻你身上的味道嘛～。……嗅嗅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "c67c29e10f76fca04e6d52098940d276d8167b0fcee59ead74e1e4fce5e8d3a3", "ja": "おや～……？", "zh": "哎呀～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1026_staff", "source_sha256": "2a43250b0fa0fc05a6435b828271d97d450194daf87ac2c56cc96a25668fec38", "ja": "すみませーん！　まもなく本番始まりますので、\nスタジオ入り、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "不好意思——！正式演出马上就要开始了，\n请进摄影棚准备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1027_204xxx", "source_sha256": "ac70205f1192990227642f1a0c826d766dc39353319f7ca87533bed4f919eb3c", "ja": "ほらほら、本番だって。シキちゃん行くよ～。\nそれじゃまたね～、アデュー♪", "zh": "快快，正式演出要开始了。志希，我们走啦～那就回头见～拜拜♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "61200e0ed027d74031a55aa18dbb7306b0b5950daec30e0c94af136f62a5953e", "ja": "なんだか、面白い人たちだネ～！\nワタシ達も行こ、ミヤ！　{$P$}！", "zh": "真是群有意思的人呢～！我们也走吧，美也！{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c07c286457c4f4b7691d7e51aed38647b7ce37319039af493f50abf3aaa958cc", "ja": "（アイドル達はバラエティ色の強い、様々な形式の\nクイズに挑戦する……頑張れ美也、エレナ！）", "zh": "（偶像们将挑战各种形式、综艺风格浓厚的问答……加油，美也、艾蕾娜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1031_205xxx", "source_sha256": "0671d1ebb587b2671d4af083ac357f19a60a4b8c7edd84fe0858f3dbe9aac73e", "ja": "あれ？　お隣さんだね～。\nよろしく～、いい匂いの美也ちゃん？", "zh": "咦？原来是邻座呢～。\n请多关照啦～，香喷喷的美也？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "14de3e0367ef520332c299684dfb55fb185c669b1d11f1ffc5162cd1d0c90c99", "ja": "はい、志希さん。負けませんよ～？\n優勝は、私達『Cleasky』です～。", "zh": "好的，志希小姐。我不会输的哦～？\n冠军会是我们『Cleasky』～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1033_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "0569c1f2936cc9098f07d1c9dc9c1c78a90f40397fd09e628795bac8bfd5c47e", "ja": "それではまずは、早押しクイズからです。\n問題！　日本で一番高い山といえば……。", "zh": "那么首先是抢答问答环节。\n题目！说到日本最高的山，那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
