{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1044_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "5d4c9e9334474ecffc1e53021ba9632ee044a6d9e117d4249d9632006d17637a", "ja": "次は業界用語からの出題です。\n『ゲーセン』とは、なんでしょうか？", "zh": "接下来是关于行业术语的问题。\n“游戏厅”指的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1045_se", "source_sha256": "7f78a84b8557ac53d9ff6e854da209b95fb2e4dbc198975d0503c05e5a168acb", "ja": "ピンポーン！", "zh": "叮咚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1046_204xxx", "source_sha256": "82f08d017142cab00756a5e28d5b6a950a58a3b445e7a417cd4470813619943b", "ja": "フレちゃんがもらった～！　ウチの事務所に\nお金に詳しい子がいるから、これはわかるよ～！", "zh": "小芙拿到了～！我们事务所有个很懂钱的孩子，所以这个我知道哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1047_205xxx", "source_sha256": "5b43a8958aff9d3e6af8594f102c2e6ec461fe2d21e66f8c03625ef47d98d721", "ja": "5000円！", "zh": "5000日元！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1048_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "aeeb742c04a822d345f9549bcef922b08b259aa487adec4511c314ea33cc82c4", "ja": "……正解です！", "zh": "……回答正确！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1049_204xxx", "source_sha256": "7d77c543445650d28f3e8c3df69e560af439e150b3d26716a1bd447fbf3b86ff", "ja": "あーっ、見せ場をシキちゃんに取られた～！\nユニット存続の危機だよー！　ピンチだよー！", "zh": "啊～，出风头的机会被志希抢走了～！\n组合存续的危机啊～！大危机呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1050_205xxx", "source_sha256": "6b43d3005c1bfbad5797fbd63a96fb1562c010a5be8621288a8ae9ed8220cf9a", "ja": "フレちゃん頑張って～、\nピンチを乗り越えると絆が深まるっていうよ～！", "zh": "小芙蕾，加油～  \n听说克服危机后，羁绊会变得更加深厚哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1051_042miy", "source_sha256": "9b0a4d1fe36a0e3d3ffb278621fc466ab7ccf6697c74d15b1e6cfbb5f2612d2a", "ja": "む～ん、やりますな～……。", "zh": "嗯～，真有一套呢～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1052_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "57e44a34dfe5809dc843ef3663f05b3684e811b419dc8db0f5c98d4e4b495bca", "ja": "それでは次は、早食いクイズです！　あちらにある\n特大シュークリームを食べきってから答えてください。", "zh": "那么接下来是速食问答！请吃完那边的超大泡芙后再回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1053_204xxx", "source_sha256": "36e8862e77e140d62a480bf8c01484a898f111cae7970889803b78e053baf11a", "ja": "うわー、すっごく大きい！\nプライベートでお上品に食べたかったな～。", "zh": "哇——好大一个啊！\n真想在私底下优雅地享用呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1054_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "f7d64e4d6c9bc5cc9ab016c5b4fd5467d6c9d0980df8369e0b688915bf22a758", "ja": "それでは問題です。サンバ・カーニバルで有名な、\nブラジルの観光都市といえば？", "zh": "那么问题来了。说到以桑巴狂欢节闻名的巴西旅游城市，是哪座？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1055_042miy", "source_sha256": "c8de34347f6fc678a1018690e7109f74ab66a154247a063715cd16217dd0dc73", "ja": "もぐ。もぐもぐ……。", "zh": "嚼。嚼嚼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1056_205xxx", "source_sha256": "d77d0eae8d184d81875e150c2ab0659a42dacf29cd0fd492059c1e681aab9617", "ja": "もぐもぐ……んー、美味し～！\n脳に糖分が染みわたるね～……もぐもぐ～。", "zh": "嚼嚼……嗯～，好吃～！\n糖分渗进大脑里了呢～……嚼嚼～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1057_018ele", "source_sha256": "b170e5c31daf04e34c051e2a910e976aef1dedd48178257ee39c0852018402a9", "ja": "もぐっ、もぐっぐ……。ふぁい！\nりお・へ・はへいろ！　だオー！", "zh": "唔嚼、唔嚼嚼……。抢答！\n里约・热・哈内卢！　答对鸟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1058_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "2d3fc23cd3eb9bfe538a2f4e99019e18368ba658611bf4704eeeb20e1b79d17a", "ja": "ちょっと怪しいけど……まあいいでしょう！\nリオ・デ・ジャネイロ、正解です！", "zh": "虽然有点可疑……不过，算你对了！\n里约热内卢，回答正确！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1059_042miy", "source_sha256": "d53089f308b7565975423a9e1e3b1f5e60b9d711824c0a6adcd713fad3e026a6", "ja": "お～、やりまひらまー、えれまはん～。\nもぐもぐ。", "zh": "哦～，答对啦，真厉害～  \n嚼嚼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1060_p", "source_sha256": "dbe66d22233ca7a18e83f4ac1df2c515463d22007672ab6f3a6076384909c148", "ja": "（いよいよ最終問題。『Cleasky』と\n『レイジー・レイジー』は……同点だ！）", "zh": "（终于到了最后一道题。《Cleasky》和《Lazy Lazy》……竟然是平分！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1061_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "5776d77b09a158496710c9f65a5424dc5036091e34fd77cb077260286293bc7e", "ja": "それでは問題です！　アイドルと言えばグラビア撮影、\nそんな『グラビア』という言葉の意味は？", "zh": "那么问题来了！说到偶像，就会想到写真拍摄，那么“写真”这个词是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1062_204xxx", "source_sha256": "6639503dc77663209aa3748641a36495688591ef126e67da2e6f62b8894ea2c7", "ja": "わー、それっぽい問題きたねー。\nしかも難しい～！　シキちゃんは知ってたりする？", "zh": "哇～出了个挺有模有样的问题呢～。\n而且好难～！志希知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1063_205xxx", "source_sha256": "3a41f531b550e2216c085b26d9838aff2aab1467ae8111c9172a66980dadd5fc", "ja": "んー、知らないよ？　興味ないし。\nねーねー、美也ちゃん知ってる？", "zh": "嗯——不知道哦？我没兴趣。\n呐——呐——美也，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1064_042miy", "source_sha256": "c2f1f70c0dca7eb20a23a810934fb1cf8145cb38c4bddb09a98f55fcc915878f", "ja": "はい～！\nたしか、紙の印刷方法だったと思いますよ～。", "zh": "是的～！\n我记得，应该是一种纸张印刷方法吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1065_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "79d440cd5352b5bd3e311e3d1ff03d454a587471cb4093e8791f006150154698", "ja": "お、おおっ、まさかの正解！\n優勝は、765プロの『Cleasky』に決定です！", "zh": "哦、哦哦，居然答对了！\n冠军确定是765制作人的《Cleasky》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1066_018ele", "source_sha256": "528f8b6067bfaeb514613365a7d560f4ae685b4ac1d7ce24df8ed9eacf9ea8d9", "ja": "ヤッター！　ミヤ、すごいヨ～！\n本当に優勝しちゃった！", "zh": "太棒啦！美也，你好厉害哦～！\n真的赢得冠军了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1067_205xxx", "source_sha256": "42727f581e8527f2274a5b2a9a3ffeb6c6e70e674dbe19f1ca0e8fb90a705921", "ja": "あはは、パッと答えちゃった。\n……おもしろーい♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，一下子就答出来了。\n……真有意思～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1069_204xxx", "source_sha256": "14634f150eb071a748ebdedf714db049d88768d1a3371e8bd6dc89e2502863e5", "ja": "765プロのみなさーん、お疲れさま！\nいやー、負けちゃった！　完敗～、そしてカンパーイ♪", "zh": "765事务所的各位～，辛苦啦！\n哎呀～，输掉了呢！惨败～，然后干杯～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1070_p", "source_sha256": "9589b738825724d858fd7dfae1dea3b8165ec9d1a9c79cd0a409bc0d75664efa", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです。\n今日はありがとうございました。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。\n今天谢谢你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1071_205xxx", "source_sha256": "379a94181b408068031d005aacdbdc61321545246af932431dd1eb359564563d", "ja": "どもども～！　ねえねえ美也ちゃん、\nあのクイズよくわかったね～。最初から知ってたの？", "zh": "嗨嗨～！对了，美也，\n你居然完全搞懂了那个测验呢～一开始就知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1072_042miy", "source_sha256": "d40881a4bf799384738d14597e793e0405e138bd13e318bcd8d29f73bf2419f7", "ja": "はい～。今度、グラビアの仕事があるので。\n勉強したんです～。", "zh": "是的～因为下次有写真拍摄的工作，所以我就学习了一下～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1073_205xxx", "source_sha256": "1298cbe46217c24f22732dff672575563671f2e555609274ddf75fceb48538f9", "ja": "グラビアの勉強で、意味まで調べちゃうんだ？\nおもしろいねー！　志希ちゃんキョーミしんしん～。", "zh": "为了学习写真，连含义都要查一查啊？真有意思——！志希可是兴趣满满～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1074_204xxx", "source_sha256": "1338c1db68a20e50a4277cd6c3a607ebc09d08f711a4e8ef1377a0d838fa11a1", "ja": "ねえねえエレナちゃん、エレナちゃんってどこ出身？\nアタシも海外の出身なんだけど～。", "zh": "诶诶，艾莉娜，你是哪里人呀？\n我也是在海外出生的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1075_018ele", "source_sha256": "0ca65bd35e998498666347c98e5ccbe43b0539d09f7355074a75b481fab7fc21", "ja": "あ、えっと、ブラジルだヨ～！　フレデリカは、\nフランスなんだよネ？　資料に書いてあったヨ～！", "zh": "啊，那个，我来自巴西哦～！弗雷德莉卡是法国人，对吧？资料上写着呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1076_204xxx", "source_sha256": "13f229195689b2d94f5262d77064abb9e9235b05a71e41eec1c8b239358720d8", "ja": "そそ、フランスはパリ産の金髪ガール♪\nよろしくねエレナちゃん！　青い目仲間だ～。", "zh": "对对，法国巴黎产的金发女孩♪请多关照，艾蕾娜！我们都是蓝眼睛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1077_205xxx", "source_sha256": "287f204d037efcade916bf87d82804ef00a1891f4d326e08132b2fe9253c47da", "ja": "ふたりとも、また一緒になんかできたら\n楽しいかもね！　その時はよろしく～。", "zh": "你们两个要是能再一起做点什么，说不定会很开心呢！到时候就拜托啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1078_p", "source_sha256": "b3be18ed88f0e80804d885a39b64c4610ad3b164868f815c42167f8edc2ca299", "ja": "（また一緒に、か……一ノ瀬さんと、宮本さん。\n見た目も華があって、つい目で追ってしまう……）", "zh": "（又要一起吗……一之濑小姐和宫本小姐。两人的外表都很亮眼，不由得总是追随着她们的目光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_01_1079_p", "source_sha256": "a850d39ec7b60e8320f6b06da9118deb30018e9e9f674333416127a04b3d92d2", "ja": "（……そうだな。よし、決めた！）", "zh": "（……说得也是。好，决定了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
